icon "banner.tga"
description "A Cheats section in the Game Menu, for the player whose turn it is. Resources gives 10 or 100 of any resource, one resource per click. Units lists the units of the player's class and of its commanders' summoning rituals; click one, then a seen map square, to place 1 or 10 of it there. Restore movement: click a map square, and every unit there gets its action points back. Reveal Map puts every square of every plane in view until the next turn, as the Game Over screen's Reveal Map does. A Lua script; needs CoE5SE from Nexus Mods."
needs_glu32.dll_and_CoE5SE_enabled_at_launch
# CoE5SE takes the line above and does nothing with it. Without CoE5SE running, the game stops at
# it with its Mod Error, which names the line, instead of loading this mod without CoE5SE.
